  "question": {
    "text": "The increasing order of the <math><mtext>p</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></math> values of the following compounds is<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0215_744db3f7a540.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 183px;\" />"
