  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo></math> stability of phenoxide ion <math><mo>∝</mo></math> dispersal of –ve charge<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0215_7bf2b443afb9.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 220px; width: 439px;\" /><br />Stability of phenoxide ion <math><mo>=</mo></math> b &gt; c &gt; a &gt; d<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo></math> B &gt; C &gt; A &gt; D<br />Hence values of <math><mtext>p</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></math> in increasing order are B &lt; C &lt; A &lt; D."
